title Spike 22a: T1 only
about T2 is off until T1 plays well: the same generous economy as demo 25, but the zone's tier is 1 (the default). Blue's bot builds factories and a T1 army, and no advanced factory, engineer or T2 unit appears. 6x.

scenario economy
economy standard base_metal=30 base_energy=400
bot red off
clip 0..10800
speed 6
camera 100,250 95

at 5400 select blue factory as plants
at 5400 show plants tab 0
at 9900 select blue tank as army
at 9900 show army

# Observed: by the same 6 minutes where demo 25 has T2 rolling, blue has
# only T1: more factories and a T1 army.
at 10800 expect blue advanced-factories == 0
at 10800 expect blue heavy-tanks == 0
at 10800 expect blue howitzers == 0
at 10800 expect blue factories >= 3
at 10800 expect blue tanks >= 20
